urice Lipson Winston\\nbirth_date: 15 07 1940\\nbirth_place: London, England\\nparty: Labour\\nspouse: Lira Feigenbaum (m. 1973)\\nchildren: 3, including Ben Winston\\nalma_mater: London Hospital Medical College\\noccupation: Surgeon, scientist, television presenter, politician, and peer\\nsignature: RobertWinstonsignature.jpg ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Robert_Winston,_Baron_Winston\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d18\"},\"ref\":\"d18\",\"snippet\":\" ... John's Children's Hospital, St. Ann's Maternity Hospital, the Boarding Department, the Adoption Department, St. Mary's Temporary Shelter for unmarried mothers, and the St. Joseph's-by-the-Sea annex.\\n\\nThe two hospitals were closed in 1945 and 1946. After that, the Foundling focused less ... \",\"title\":\"https://findingaids.library.nyu.edu/nyhs/ms347_foundling_hospital/all/\"}],\"next_step\":\"Inspect navigation; read a relevant page or change the locating clue.\",\"observation\":{\"first_delivered_source_round\":null,\"prior_deliveries\":0,\"query_key\":\"211ea531b66893032114f0ef0be40dfc71e276d914a1ede16e8aec5e6987defa\",\"replay_requested\":false,\"result_fingerprint\":\"b0f961590a6d18b887de6ba6e8dfc17fb8f0cccc7fe0f6ca7f7203364757a645\",\"semantic_progress\":\"not_measured\"},\"query\":\"hospital renamed 539 days after birth baby\",\"view\":\"full\"},{\"cached\":false,\"hits\":[{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d19\"},\"ref\":\"d19\",\"snippet\":\" ... November 2021 — Led by NICHD's NCMRR, NIH publishes the NIH Research Plan on Rehabilitation to help coordinate and guide activities on medical rehabilitation across the agency.\\n\\nDecember 2021 — NICHD announces the winners of its first research challenge competition conducted through the America COMPETES A