"ref\":\"d23\"},\"ref\":\"d23\",\"snippet\":\" ... Cleveland City Hospital formally changed its name to Lakeside Hospital.\\n\\n-\\n\\n1891: Maternity Home of Cleveland, renamed Maternity Hospital in 1892, was established to provide obstetrical services and care for women throughout Cleveland.\\n\\nMaternity Home -\\n\\n1891: Rainbow Cottage opened, caring for 32 patients its first summer.\\n\\nRainbow Cottage -\\n\\n1894 ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.uhhospitals.org/about-uh/our-history\"}],\"next_step\":\"Inspect navigation; read a relevant page or change the locating clue.\",\"observation\":{\"first_delivered_source_round\":null,\"prior_deliveries\":0,\"query_key\":\"768e318c92eb9a732ed01bf23f78648adc63eae5b6be3d1463badb64e9adda27\",\"replay_requested\":false,\"result_fingerprint\":\"ce1b589139428e2a44fc3bb4a70f5705ed323af1ab3f580f1f4a066adc977ed4\",\"semantic_progress\":\"not_measured\"},\"query\":\"hospital renamed 2021 2022 maternity\",\"view\":\"full\"},{\"cached\":false,\"hits\":[{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d24\"},\"ref\":\"d24\",\"snippet\":\" ... The Boy in the Field by Margot Livesey\\n\\nLivesey's latest novel opens with three siblings finding a dead body. Wearing matching school uniforms, they move together through the scene almost as if they were protagonists of an early children's adventure novel. These are not, however, parentless ... \",\"title\":\"https://electricliterature.com/7-books-that-expand-the-conversation-about-adoption/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d25\"},\"ref\":\"d25\",\"snippet\":\" ... Dunn did this to set the novel up to follow two storylines: the one that Olympia (Oly), our bald-albino-hunchbacked-dwarf (!) narrator tells during her childhood and adolescence with the carnival; and the present-day story of Oly as an adult, living in a the same boarding ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.goodreads.com/book/show/13872.Geek_Love\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d26\"},\"ref\":\"d26\",\"snippet\":\" ... Borne by Jeff VanderMeer\\n\\nIn a list of books featuring animal protagonists, it might seem nonsensical to include a novel about a woman named Rachel who befriends a sentient rubbery sea anemone-like creature named Borne, and who, along with her partner, feels hunted by a vicious (and ... \",\"title\":\"https://electricliterature.com/9-novels-for-readers-interested-in-animal-perspectives/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d27\"},\"ref\":\"d27\",\"snippet\":\" ... A 1978 documentary Dionne Quintuplets, narrated by Pierre Berton, included news footage and interviews.\\n\\nThe 1994 TV miniseries Million Dollar Babies Tucker, Ken (November 18, 1994). \\\"Million Dollar Babies (review)\\\". Entertainment Weekly. was based on the novel Time of Their Lives—The Dionne Tragedy.\\n\\nThe publicity around the ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dionne_quintuplets\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d28\"},\"ref\":\"d28\",\"snippet\":\" ... Caught between parents, languages, and cultures, the narrator devotes herself to academic study. Only after her best friend has a baby does she begin to comprehend love, the one power source, according to Einstein, man has never mastered. Wang offers a unique blend of scientific observations, Chinese proverbs ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.publishersweekly.com/pw/by-topic/industry-news/tip-sheet/article/75638-the-most-read-book-reviews-of-2017.html\"}],\"next_step\":\"Inspect navigation; read a relevant page or change the locating clue.\",\"observation\":{\"first_delivered_source_round\":null,\"prior_deliveries\":0,\"query_key\":\"2a4ae547424d4eafc02371ad34bff2cd8c05623e4fa9fc1bb143efc81ea8b2be\",\"replay_requested\":false,\"result_fingerprint\":\"c0b0b711007f1f31294fe21fe6eea0567ba18ad0c9cf9e9d163634f1a8e39056\",\"semantic_progress\":\"not_measured\"},\"query\":\"novel narrator name baby born same day sibling\",\"view\":\"full\"}]}","role":"tool","tool_call_id":"call_f1e79a1c34e246ac9df1396e"},{"content":"{\"action_slot_charged\":true,\"executed\":true,\"ok\":true,\"results\":[{\"cached\":false,\"hits\":[{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d29\"},\"ref\":\"d29\",\"snippet\":\" ... Cannon welcomed a second of twins, Zion and Zillion Heir, in June 2021 with DJ Abby De La Rosa. That same month, his seventh child, Zen, was born to model Alyssa Scott. Zen tragically died of brain cancer at 5 months old in December 2021.\\n\\nIn January 2022 ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.businessinsider.com/celebrities-with-large-families-kids-2020-5\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d30\"},\"ref\":\"d30\",\"snippet\":\" ... wedding date was the last Sunday in July. This would mean their nuptials are set to take place on Sunday 25th July! Eek - we can't wait to see the pictures!\\n\\nJune 2021: Stacey and Joe confirm they are expecting their second child\\n\\nIn June 2021 the happy ... \",\"title\":\"https://hellorayo.co.uk/hits-radio/entertainment/celebrity/stacey-solomon-instagram-troll\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d31\"},\"ref\":\"d31\",\"snippet\":\" ... fourth child, Prince Edward, is born.\\n\\n- May 1965: